message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Code for: Temporal dynamics and evolution of Antarctic dry extremes using Multi-temporal Rarity Curves"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nworgu
    given-names: Uzoma C.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-6536-5480"
    affiliation: "Institut des Géosciences de l'Environnement (IGE), Université Grenoble Alpes, Grenoble, France; Institute for Marine and Antarctic Studies (IMAS), University of Tasmania, Hobart, Australia"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/yuzee-333/phd_antarctic_dry_extremes"
abstract: >-
  Python scripts that produce the figures for a study applying the
  Multi-temporal Rarity Curve (MRC) framework to MAR v3.12 daily
  precipitation over Antarctic drainage basins, 1979–2023, to classify
  and characterise dry extremes.
keywords:
  - Antarctica
  - precipitation
  - drought
  - dry extremes
  - MAR
  - Multi-temporal Rarity Curves
